<v Laura>During that dinner, I glanced over and noticed that she was cutting up the meat on Don's plate, like his steak or something, and I was just like what-- I was just like, what is happening? This is so strange to me.
<v Laura>在那顿晚饭期间，我瞥了一眼，注意到她正在切唐盘子里的肉，比如他的牛排什么的，我当时就想，什么——我当时就想，这到底是怎么回事？这对我来说太奇怪了。

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:05.470
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Cutting his meat, like she was leaning over his plate?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>切他的肉，就像她身体前倾越过他的盘子一样？

