<v Onnesha>不，那样我就输了。

00:28:23.700 --> 00:28:45.420
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Onnesha felt like Don was not talking to her, but to The Hypnotizer, that he did not want to engage her as a professional discussing her compensation, but as an attractive young woman struggling with her rent. He didn't want to be a boss paying for her work, but a savior paying for her life. Onnesha didn't want that kind of help.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>奥内莎觉得唐并不是在跟她说话，而是在跟“催眠师”说话，他不想把她当作一个探讨薪酬的专业人士来对待，而是把她当作一个为房租苦恼的有魅力的年轻女性。他不想当一个为她的工作付钱的老板，而是想当一个资助她生活的拯救者。奥内莎不想要这种帮助。

00:28:45.420 --> 00:28:48.210
<v Onnesha>Maybe it's kind of petty, but I was like, you are not going to win.
