00:40:43.590 --> 00:40:52.770
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Jeff denies all of this, by the way. Tana did tell her parents, though it took her a while. They were protective. She was worried they would make her quit.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>顺便说一句，杰夫否认了这一切。不过塔娜确实告诉了她的父母，虽然花了一段时间。他们很有保护欲。她担心他们会让她辞职。

00:40:52.770 --> 00:40:57.230
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>And then, they were driving one day, her mom, her dad, Tana in the backseat.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>然后有一天，他们在开车，妈妈、爸爸，塔娜坐在后座。

00:40:57.230 --> 00:41:04.780
<v Tana>Then I was like, mom and dad, I have something to tell you. And I was very dramatic about it. And they're like what? What happened? And I remember, like, taking a deep breath and saying--
<v Tana>然后我说，爸爸妈妈，我有件事要告诉你们。我当时表现得非常有戏剧性。他们问什么？发生什么事了？我记得，自己好像深吸了一口气，然后说——

00:41:04.780 --> 00:41:05.460
<v Tana>[SIGHING]
<v Tana>[叹气]

00:41:05.460 --> 00:41:06.960
<v Tana>--I've been sexually harassed.
<v Tana>——我被性骚扰了。

00:41:06.960 --> 00:41:20.910
<v Tana>And they kind of laughed in my face, and they're like, what the hell do you expect, you're a 19-year-old woman. Of course you're being sexually harassed. I thought, oh, that's just a thing that happens that I can accept everywhere I'm going to work.
<v Tana>他们当着我的面笑了出来，说，你到底期望什么样的事发生，你可是个19岁的年轻女性。你当然会被性骚扰啊。我想，哦，这只是一件无论我去哪里工作都得接受的事情。

00:41:20.910 --> 00:41:37.870
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Tana worked a lot of different jobs and got a lot of education-- college, graduate school, which did not open a path to a graduate school job, but a job at a Whole Foods. That's when her roommate told her she knew an editor of a political news website. Would Tana be interested?
